      <h1>Inside Berlin's €36 Billion Plan to Seize 240,000 Apartments</h1>
      <p class="dek">Berlin made a party that wants to convert nearly 240,000 corporate apartments into public housing its strongest since reunification. Two neighbors read the same 25.7% headline and had opposite mornings. Here is the real bill: 8 to 36 billion euros.</p>

      <div class="video-wrap">
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/rQrqCS4bga4" title="Inside Berlin's €36 Billion Plan to Seize 240,000 Apartments" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>
    </div>
